The '''Skrilling'''<ref name="Updated and Expanded">''[[Star Wars: Absolutely Everything You Need to Know, Updated and Expanded]]''</ref> were a three-[[Limb|fingered]], bipedal [[Sentience|sentient]] [[species]] with [[Color|green]] skin<ref name="Return of the Jedi" /> and brown [[eye]]s.<ref name="Holocron Heist" /> The [[arms dealer]] [[Pote Snitkin]] was a Skrilling,<ref name="Updated and Expanded" /> as was the [[Jedi Knight]] [[Ord Enisence]].<ref name="Holocron Heist" />

